WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.435
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.536
We're hanging out with
Chloe Fineman!

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:06.239
We love Chloe.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:08.608
I love your impressions.
I really do.

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.176
You're one of my favorites
out there.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.578
With that in mind, I wanted to
challenge you to something new.

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:15.715
It's time for "Interview of
Impressions." Here we go.

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:18.651
♪ -Interview of Impressions,
yeah ♪

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.286
-Alright, here's how it works,
okay?

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.288
We're going to have a normal
conversation with each other,

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:24.757
except every so often we're
going to hear this ding sound.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.025
-Okay.
[ Ding! ]

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:27.961
-And when you hear that,
your impression will change

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:29.562
as we keep talking.
-Okay.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:30.796
-Is that okay?
-Yeah.

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:34.367
-Okay. Here we go.
I'll start the conversation.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:37.370
The weather is cooling down,
as we all know.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.504 line:0%
-Yeah.
[ Ding! ]

00:00:38.504 --> 00:00:40.606 line:0%
-Big fall plans maybe?

00:00:40.606 --> 00:00:44.543 line:0%
-[ as Coolidge ] Oh, I'm gonna
make you a pie, dumbass.

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:45.678 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:48.147 line:0%
Yeah.

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:49.816 line:0%
-Oh, Jennifer. Oh, my goodness.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:52.018 line:0%
[ Ding! ]

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:54.186 line:0%
-[ as Portman ]
Fall is fascinating.

00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:55.955 line:0%
It's like summer.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:01:00.392 line:0%
But then it's colder than
summer. It's bizarre, right?

00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:04.464 line:0%
It's so interesting, like --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:07.567 line:0%
[ Ding! ]
-It is. It is summer but fall.

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.468 line:0%
Yeah, Natalie,
you are correct, yeah.

00:01:09.468 --> 00:01:11.471 line:0%
-[ as Streep ]
Oh, well, you know, the fall.

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:12.571 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.571 --> 00:01:14.339 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Oh!

00:01:14.339 --> 00:01:16.609 line:0%
Oh, my.
-Wow.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:23.749 line:0%
-Jimmy, I love to make a spiced
cider with cardamom and nutmeg.

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:25.918 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
Star anise.

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:27.219 line:0%
-Oh, star anise?
-Yeah.

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:28.988 line:0%
-Meryl Streep likes star anise.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:32.425 line:0%
-Yes, yes, you know,
the devil might wear Prada,

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:36.596 line:0%
but this autumn bottom
wears scarves.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.863 line:0%
-Oh!
[ Ding! ]

00:01:37.863 --> 00:01:39.465 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]
I love that.

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:41.801 line:0%
You wear scarves.
You wear whatever you like.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.035 line:0%
Yeah.

00:01:43.035 --> 00:01:46.238 line:0%
But, Jennifer, what do you
think of Halloween?

00:01:46.238 --> 00:01:48.308 line:0%
-[ Laughing as Lawrence ]

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:53.946 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:55.447 line:0%
It was crazy.

00:01:55.447 --> 00:01:59.352 line:0%
-Yeah, it is a little crazy
there, yeah.

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:04.657 line:0%
Keira, do you prefer Halloween
or jack-o'-lanterns or pumpkins?

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.626 line:0%
-[ as Knightley ]
Very fragile to be here.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:08.561 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:10.429 line:0%
Have you ever seen a gourd?

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:14.233 line:0%
Like, really, truly,
deeply seen a gourd?

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:15.768 line:0%
-A gourd?
-A gourd.

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:18.070 line:0%
-A gourd, no.
-Sorry for my dictation.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.340 line:0%
If my lips touch each other,
I will die.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.175 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-I did not know that.

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:24.777 line:0%
[ Ding! ]
[ Applause ]

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:29.582 line:0%
-[ Normal voice ] That was
Sudi Green, a Sudi Green joke.

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:32.852 line:0%
-Well, Elizabeth Holmes, I mean,
you're currently on trial.

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:35.822 line:0%
I mean, this is --
-[ as Holmes ] Yeah. Yeah.

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:37.323 line:0%
-What is it --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:39.692 line:0%
Are you okay talking about --
being here and talking about --

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.194 line:0%
-I can say what I can, you know.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.862 line:0%
First, they --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.862 --> 00:02:46.599 line:0%
First, they question you.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.034 line:0%
They challenge you.

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:49.802 line:0%
-Of course they challenge you
and they question you, yeah.

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:52.338 line:0%
-And then they put you in prison
for 20 years.

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:53.606 line:0%
-Yes, that's exactly
what they do.

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:54.673 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:54.673 --> 00:02:56.509 line:0%
[ Dinging ]
Oh, my goodness.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:58.243
This is Chloe Fineman,
by the way.

00:02:58.243 --> 00:03:00.813
[ Cheers and applause ]
How do you do all of those?

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.816
With the eyes.
Chloe Fineman, amazing!

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:06.853
Check her out on the new season
of "Saturday Night Live"

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:09.222
this weekend with
host Owen Wilson

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.224
and musical guest
Kacey Musgraves!

